  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><br><span style=\"font-size:24px\">英文：</span></p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\">適用於 1.12.2、1.16.5、1.20.1 版本的 Immersive Vehicles 模組擴充包，新增軍事與民用裝備、汽車、飛機、直升機、摩托車、自行車，你想要的「一切」都有！</h2>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:36px\">民用交通工具 &nbsp; &nbsp; <span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/V27ufUNDTg0\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span><br><img src=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cmatransportpack/screenshots\" alt=\"\" width=\"Infinity\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1053/786/2024-12-31_10.png\" width=\"561\" height=\"315\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1446/276/1-png.png\" width=\"561\" height=\"316\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1446/279/4-png.png\" width=\"561\" height=\"316\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1446/278/3-png.png\" width=\"561\" height=\"316\"><img src=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cmatransportpack/screenshots\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1446/277/2-png.png\" width=\"561\" height=\"316\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1446/286/11-png.png\" width=\"561\" height=\"316\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1053/790/2024-12-31_13.png\" width=\"561\" height=\"315\"><br>民用交通</span><br><br>- GAZ 31105 <br>- Volzhyanin 52701 <br>- ZIL-130 - <br>Ford E 系列 <br>- Hummer H2 <br>- Minsk - <br>KAMAZ 消防車 - VAZ <br>-2115 - Mitsubishi Lancer Evo 10 - Mitsubishi Fuso Canter - KAMAZ 6x4 低頂車身 - KAMAZ 6x4 長軸車身 - KAMAZ 6x4 高頂車身 - KAMAZ 8x8 高頂車身 - KAMAZ 8x8 短軸車身 - KAMAZ 4x4 車身 - KAMAZ 4x4 長軸車身 - MAZ 4x4 車身 - MAZ 6x4 車身 - MAZ 6x4 長軸車身 - PAZ Vector - Nissan Primera P10 - Yenisey-950 - Don-1500B - MTZ-82.1 - MTZ-80 - HTZ-17221 - HTZ-17221-21 <span style=\"font-size:36px\">軍用交通 </span><span style=\"font-size:36px\">軍用運輸 </span><span style=\"font-size:18px\">蘇聯／俄羅斯戰車</span> - KV-85 - T-34-85 - IS-2-1944 - T-62 - T-72B3 - BMP-2 - BMP-2M - BTR-80A - BTR-80 - T-72B3 - TOS-1A - 2S19 Msta-S - T-80BV - T-80BVM - T-90A - T-90M<br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1446/284/9-png.png\" alt=\"蘇聯戰車\" width=\"371\" height=\"209\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1446/281/6-png.png\" width=\"371\" height=\"209\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1446/282/7-png.png\" width=\"371\" height=\"209\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1446/283/8-png.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"371\" height=\"209\"><br><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1446/294/12-png.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"371\" height=\"209\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1446/295/13-png.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"371\" height=\"209\"><br><br></span><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">蘇聯／俄羅斯交通工具</span><br>- ZIS-5「Katisha」<br>- ZIS-5 防空砲 <br>- 9K72 Elbrus <br>- BM-21「冰雹」<br>- Pantsir-S1 <br>- Pantsir-S1M <br>- KAMAZ 63968「Typhoon」<br>- GAZ Tigr</p>\n<p><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">蘇聯火炮</span><br>- ZIS-3 <br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">德國戰車</span><br>- Pz.Kpfw. IV <br>- 維伯溫德 <br>- SDKFZ 234/2 <br>- Panther G <br>- Tiger II <br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">德國運輸載具</span><br>- Opel Blitz <br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">德國火炮</span><br>- 75 毫米 PaK 40 <br><br><span style=\"font-size:36px\">軍用航空器 </span><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1446/275/image-png.png\" alt=\"軍用航空器\" width=\"561\" height=\"315\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1446/280/5-png.png\" width=\"561\" height=\"316\"><br><span style=\"font-size:36px\">軍用航空器 </span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">蘇聯／俄羅斯</span></p>\n<p>- Su-34 <br>- Su-25「灰鵲」<br>- MiG-21 <br>- MiG-23 <br>- Mi-24 <br>- Ka-52 <br>- Mi-8 <br>- Mi-8 AMTS <br>- Mi-171Sh <br>- Pe-8 <br>- Il-2 <br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">德國</span><br>- Ju-87 <br>- Ar-234 <br><br>槍械 <br><br>- AK-105 <br>- AK-105 瞄準鏡 <br>- AK-<br>12 -AK-12 瞄準鏡 -AKS-74U <br>- RPK <br>- 74m <br>- PM <br>- PKM <br>- SVD <br>- 瞄準鏡<br>SVD -VSS <br>- VSS 狙擊步槍專用瞄準鏡 <br>- SV-98 - 瞄準鏡<br>SV-98 <br>- RPG-7 <br><br><span style=\"font-size:36px\">民用航空器 </span><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/638/540/2023-03-24_12.png\" alt=\"波音 767\" width=\"500\" height=\"281\"><br><span style=\"font-size:36px\">民用航空器</span><br><br>- 波音 767 <br><br><br><span style=\"font-size:36px\">軍用艦艇 </span><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/658/767/2023-05-08_23.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"528\" height=\"297\"><br><span style=\"font-size:36px\">軍用艦艇 </span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\">- 俾斯麥號</span><br><br><br><br></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">安裝 Immersive Vehicles 模組包需搭配 </span><br><span style=\"font-size:24px\">Immersive Transport 擴充模組。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><br><br><br>&nbsp;</p>",
